---
import siteConfig from '../data/site-config.json';
---

<!-- ==================== WHY CHOOSE RESELLER SECTION ==================== -->
<section class="reseller-section section-padding-lg" id="reseller-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split-grid">
      <div class="split-content">
        <span class="section-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase"></i> IPTV Reseller Business Opportunity</span>
        <h2>Why the IPTV Reseller Model is the Best Business Opportunity in 2026</h2>
        
        <p>
          IPTV reselling removes every technical barrier to entry. You don't need expensive satellite dishes, encoders, streaming servers, or massive engineering teams. With a professional <strong>IPTV reseller panel</strong>, you gain a complete web dashboard to create trial accounts, activate subscriptions, manage customers, process renewals, and sell IPTV services—all under your own brand name.
        </p>

        <p>
          Our platform connects you with dedicated high-throughput streaming clusters that offer ultra-stable panels, massive 4K VOD libraries (<strong>200,000+ movies &amp; series</strong>), comprehensive live TV coverage (<strong>51,000+ channels</strong>), and dedicated 24/7 technical assistance. The demand for IPTV subscriptions in <strong>USA, UK, Europe, Canada, and Australia</strong> is accelerating as millions cut the cord on traditional cable packages.
        </p>

        <p>
          As a 4KSubscriptionIPTV reseller, you tap into a high-margin recurring revenue model with up to 70% profit margins. You control your retail pricing, manage your clients via Xtream UI / 1-Stream, and maintain 100% white-label brand independence.
        </p>

        <div class="icon-list-grid">
          <div class="icon-list-item">
            <div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-plus"></i></div>
            <span>Create unlimited customer accounts instantly</span>
          </div>
          <div class="icon-list-item">
            <div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock"></i></div>
            <span>Manage 24H trials and automated renewals</span>
          </div>
          <div class="icon-list-item">
            <div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i></div>
            <span>Build recurring monthly revenue streams (Up to 70% Margin)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="icon-list-item">
            <div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-globe"></i></div>
            <span>Sell across US, UK, EU, CA &amp; AU</span>
          </div>
          <div class="icon-list-item">
            <div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-paint-brush"></i></div>
            <span>100% White-label with custom DNS brand</span>
          </div>
          <div class="icon-list-item">
            <div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-headset"></i></div>
            <span>24/7 dedicated engineering server support</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href={siteConfig.whatsappUrl} class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase"></i> Access Reseller Panel Portal
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-card glass-card premium-card">
        <span class="pricing-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-rocket"></i> Reseller Starter Path</span>
        <h3>Start Small. Scale Fast. Build Your Empire.</h3>
        
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle"></i> Instant automated Xtream UI &amp; 1-Stream panel setup</li>
          <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle"></i> Generate unlimited 24-hour customer test trials</li>
          <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle"></i> Wholesale credit packs from 10 to 500+ credits</li>
          <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle"></i> 50% to 70% profit margins on 1, 3, 6 &amp; 12-month lines</li>
          <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle"></i> Multi-Room sub-account provisioning (1 to 5 devices)</li>
          <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle"></i> 24/7 WhatsApp VIP engineering desk: <strong>{siteConfig.whatsappDisplay}</strong></li>
          <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle"></i> Full access to 51,000+ 4K channels &amp; 200k+ VODs</li>
          <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle"></i> 100% Risk-Free SLA &amp; Money-Back Guarantee</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="pricing-cta-wrap">
          <a href={siteConfig.whatsappUrl} class="btn btn-primary full-width pulse-animation" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-headset"></i> Request Reseller Access Now
          </a>
          <p class="pricing-note">No technical experience required. We guide you step-by-step.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .reseller-section {
    padding: 80px 0;
    background: rgba(10, 15, 30, 0.4);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .split-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .split-content h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.3rem);
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .split-content p {
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .icon-list-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 240px), 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 24px 0 30px 0;
  }

  .icon-list-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  .icon-box {
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #38bdf8;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .icon-list-item span {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  /* Right Pricing Card */
  .pricing-card {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(17, 24, 48, 0.9) 0%, rgba(10, 15, 30, 0.95) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.35);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 36px 30px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 30px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
    position: relative;
  }

  .pricing-label {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
    color: #fbbf24;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .pricing-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .feature-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .feature-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .feature-list li i {
    color: #10b981;
    margin-top: 3px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .pricing-cta-wrap {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .pricing-note {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .split-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
